,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l003","ordinal":359099,"en":"Untouched by wind when storms arose."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l004","ordinal":359100,"en":"Among this Kyrgyz people,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l005","ordinal":359101,"en":"I was one who stood his ground."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l006","ordinal":359102,"en":"No wind touched us when tempests raged,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l007","ordinal":359103,"en":"We gave no livestock to claimants."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l008","ordinal":359104,"en":"We yielded no sheep when wolves came,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l009","ordinal":359105,"en":"We yielded no ground when foes came."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l010","ordinal":359106,"en":"In courage, a lion and a tiger,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l011","ordinal":359107,"en":"I had the strength of any man."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l012","ordinal":359108,"en":"You were a crag like a mountain host,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l013","ordinal":359109,"en":"Yielding neither pass nor road;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l014","ordinal":359110,"en":"I was a lofty, rocky mountain."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l015","ordinal":359111,"en":"While my broad nation endured,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l016","ordinal":359112,"en":"Whenever hunger came upon me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l017","ordinal":359113,"en":"I would carve off a haunch and eat."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l018","ordinal":359114,"en":"While this dear head of mine remained,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l019","ordinal":359115,"en":"Of every human being born,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l020","ordinal":359116,"en":"Throughout the eighteen thousand worlds,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l021","ordinal":359117,"en":"Of any mortal who confronted me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l022","ordinal":359118,"en":"Of any champion who faced me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l023","ordinal":359119,"en":"I would say, “Let him bring his grievance!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l024","ordinal":359120,"en":"Whenever hunger came upon me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l025","ordinal":359121,"en":"I would slice off rich fat and eat."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l026","ordinal":359122,"en":"“What enemy would dare to come"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l027","ordinal":359123,"en":"And face me in combat?” I would say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l028","ordinal":359124,"en":"The wild game upon the hills—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l029","ordinal":359125,"en":"If I caught one with cloven hoof,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l030","ordinal":359126,"en":"“I shall make it tame as cattle,” I would say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l031","ordinal":359127,"en":"“If I assail the whole wide world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l032","ordinal":359128,"en":"I shall make it submit,” I would say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l033","ordinal":359129,"en":"Chasing the blue-gray maral,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l034","ordinal":359130,"en":"“I shall make it livestock,” I would say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l035","ordinal":359131,"en":"If a hostile, predatory foe came,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l036","ordinal":359132,"en":"“I shall humble him,” I would say."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l037","ordinal":359133,"en":"In those days my strength and courage"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l038","ordinal":359134,"en":"Had risen to their highest flood."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l039","ordinal":359135,"en":"The forty saints, Khizr and Ilyas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b002:l040","ordinal":359136,"en":"Were far away from me then;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l001","ordinal":359137,"en":"It was my time to flee."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l002","ordinal":359138,"en":"The reason I stood afraid was this:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l003","ordinal":359139,"en":"Against the infidel, the ogre’s son,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l004","ordinal":359140,"en":"I went to face him brow to brow."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l005","ordinal":359141,"en":"Swinging axes and thrusting spears,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l006","ordinal":359142,"en":"We fought with savage roars."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l007","ordinal":359143,"en":"Heads no bigger than an ankle-bone were struck,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l008","ordinal":359144,"en":"Armor impervious to bullets was torn,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l009","ordinal":359145,"en":"And the ringed iron helmet"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l010","ordinal":359146,"en":"Was dented by the axe-blows."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l011","ordinal":359147,"en":"Exerting all our strength,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l012","ordinal":359148,"en":"Sparing not our reckless lives,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l013","ordinal":359149,"en":"We stood confronting one another;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l014","ordinal":359150,"en":"With Zulfuqar, the sword that cleaves a camel,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l015","ordinal":359151,"en":"Striking back and forth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l016","ordinal":359152,"en":"We remained locked face to face."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l017","ordinal":359153,"en":"Firing guns and drawing bows,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l018","ordinal":359154,"en":"We battled in a bloody clash."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l019","ordinal":359155,"en":"All the blood was swallowed up;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l020","ordinal":359156,"en":"My kandagai trousers and Akolpok armor"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l021","ordinal":359157,"en":"Were utterly shredded away,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l022","ordinal":359158,"en":"Yet nothing I did availed me."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l023","ordinal":359159,"en":"For seven months I fought without rest,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l024","ordinal":359160,"en":"But Sarybai, the ogre’s son,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l025","ordinal":359161,"en":"Never once so much as staggered."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l026","ordinal":359162,"en":"When I struck with a club, its point would not pierce;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l027","ordinal":359163,"en":"That grim-visaged swine—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l028","ordinal":359164,"en":"When I thrust my mace, its point would not pierce,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l029","ordinal":359165,"en":"When I fired my gun, its bullet would not pierce."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l030","ordinal":359166,"en":"Striking at him, I could not prevail;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l031","ordinal":359167,"en":"Grappling with him, I could not conquer."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0817:b004:l032","ordinal":359168,"en":"My sleeves burned and my heart was scorched;"}]
